WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.400
Here's what done looks like.

2
00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:05.937
Every account has a proposal, or a
finding that names the missing fact.

3
00:00:05.937 --> 00:00:08.235
Every account has its owner's decision,

4
00:00:08.235 --> 00:00:10.963
with any departure from
the matrix explained.

5
00:00:10.963 --> 00:00:12.794
Nothing kept lives forever,

6
00:00:12.794 --> 00:00:16.775
and every Kerberos keep has an
owner and an accepted end date.

7
00:00:16.775 --> 00:00:20.192
The high-risk accounts go first,
every wave has a way back,

8
00:00:20.192 --> 00:00:24.575
and the licensing scope holds only
identities it can actually protect.

9
00:00:24.575 --> 00:00:26.324
With every account decided,

10
00:00:26.324 --> 00:00:30.887
Chapter 4 moves on to app management
policies and certificate rotation.

11
00:00:30.887 --> 00:00:32.040
Thanks for watching.
